Think carefully before you move in this turn-based battle system where enemies move right after you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the Erosion. You won't last long when it reaches its limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize one step ahead and utilize all your belongings to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay vigilant; you never know when you'll encounter the deadly traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9fa41b574da09a34b8bc63dec9602a56.webp?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/2a1067c836afc4d2ab6905afc7d7cee0.poster.avif?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/2a1067c836afc4d2ab6905afc7d7cee0.webm?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/2a1067c836afc4d2ab6905afc7d7cee0.mp4?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE THAN 100 WEAPONS TO FORGE RIGHT WHERE YOU STAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create different weapons based on the materials you choose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every weapon possesses an unique Skill, broaden your playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make shattered weapons materials as well, inheriting their strength to the next masterpiece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and destroy weapons to find your own playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/a6cc92e59ecbe8a970bc917e726d117b.webp?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9e5c2cd11ad45c528afc50f625ce187b.poster.avif?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9e5c2cd11ad45c528afc50f625ce187b.webm?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9e5c2cd11ad45c528afc50f625ce187b.mp4?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERCOME DEATH AND BECOME STRONGER WITH YOUR SOULS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Souls for permanent upgrades and items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stride ahead against a variety of elite enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your might and knowledge in challenging boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Memories to reach out to the truth of &quot;this world.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/6c583a4757e27599915f3a1e1d4ed659.webp?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/e21bf68c123408d97d5c774993710c2c.poster.avif?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/e21bf68c123408d97d5c774993710c2c.webm?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/e21bf68c123408d97d5c774993710c2c.mp4?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling via both cutscenes and text-based novels with over 150K word count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 6 main characters and elite enemies are fully voiced by Japanese voice actresses, with real-time 2D animations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Steam Deck and controllers, with modifyable key configurations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9365ad2b33533bbf8e8d7246b76d8706.webp?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/d1ba1837df83597ca08fc501e985d4e6.poster.avif?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/d1ba1837df83597ca08fc501e985d4e6.webm?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/d1ba1837df83597ca08fc501e985d4e6.mp4?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You opened your eyes, but nothing could be seen.<br>Suddenly, one string of dim light shone through the darkness.<br>As you followed the light of hope, it slowly turned from azure to crimson.<br>Once again, your consciousness faded away...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You opened your eyes, and found yourself in the middle of nowhere.<br>A mysterious girl, with her monotonous tone, spoke of various confusing matters.<br>Safe House. Purpose. Erosion. Death.<br>The only way to grasp the truth is to hold on the black sword of yours,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and fight against &quot;This World,&quot; no matter the consequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/17067022f6c7d9b19c2ac77276e21de5.poster.avif?t=1786962055\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/17067022f6c7d9b19c2ac77276e21de5.webm?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/17067022f6c7d9b19c2ac77276e21de5.mp4?t=1786962055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;I will stay with you right here. Try all you can, through hell and fire's end...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/cb03e34c0863fc68a0df374e468f119f.avif?t=1786962055\" width=720 height=1280 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/eba9c6e0504ccf7ddb120be949b73324.poster.avif?t=1786962055\" width=90 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/eba9c6e0504ccf7ddb120be